extends ../layouts/main

block content
  main(class='mb-4')
    section(class='rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-slate-200')
      p(class='text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-indigo-600') Tailwind CSS
      h1(class='mt-2 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900') Welcome
      p(class='mt-4 text-slate-600') This home page is built with Express, Pug, and Tailwind CSS.
      .mt-6.flex.flex-wrap.gap-3
        a(class='rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-700', href='/about') About page
        a(class='rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50', href='/users') Users
  .columns-3
    .block.color-gray-100.bg-gray-300.p-4.mb-4.rounded-lg.shadow-md
      h2(class='text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900') Node.js
      p(class='mt-2 text-gray-700') A JavaScript runtime built on Chrome's V8 JavaScript engine.
    .block.color-gray-100.bg-gray-300.p-4.mb-4.rounded-lg.shadow-md
      h2(class='text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900') Express.js
      p(class='mt-2 text-gray-700') A minimal and flexible Node.js web application framework that provides a robust set of features for web and mobile applications.
    .block.color-gray-100.bg-gray-300.p-4.mb-4.rounded-lg.shadow-md
      h2(class='text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900') Pug
      p(class='mt-2 text-gray-700') A high-performance template engine heavily influenced by Haml and implemented with JavaScript for Node.js and browsers.